    {"id":"g_nafion_detail","type":"text","x":660,"y":336,"width":302,"height":186,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":667,"version":1,"versionNonce":667,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1749000000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Nafion adalah polimer kation-selektif:\n\n  Saliva → [Nafion] → [GOx] → WE\n\n  ✓  Glukosa          → LOLOS (netral, kecil)\n  ✓  H₂O₂             → LOLOS (netral, kecil)\n  ✗  Asam askorbat  → DIBLOKIR (anionik)\n  ✗  Asam urat        → DIBLOKIR (anionik)\n  ✗  Protein besar   → DIBLOKIR (sterik)\n\nTanpa Nafion → sinyal palsu dari interferensi\nDengan Nafion → selektivitas tinggi terhadap\nglukosa (via H₂O₂)","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"Nafion adalah polimer kation-selektif:\n\n  Saliva → [Nafion] → [GOx] → WE\n\n  ✓  Glukosa          → LOLOS (netral, kecil)\n  ✓  H₂O₂             → LOLOS (netral, kecil)\n  ✗  Asam askorbat  → DIBLOKIR (anionik)\n  ✗  Asam urat        → DIBLOKIR (anionik)\n  ✗  Protein besar   → DIBLOKIR (sterik)\n\nTanpa Nafion → sinyal palsu dari interferensi\nDengan Nafion → selektivitas tinggi terhadap\nglukosa (via H₂O₂)","lineHeight":1.5}
